* ================================================
*  MENTAL MATH TRAINER
* ================================================
*  An interactive arithmetic practice session
*  with automatic answer checking and score
*  tracking. 15 problems across five categories
*  test and build mental math fluency.
*
*  Features: C: computation, A: named input,
*  J(condition): conditional jumps for answer
*  checking, Y:/N: conditional text, U:/E:
*  subroutines, {VAR} interpolation, R: runtime.
* ================================================

C:SCORE=0
C:TOTAL=0

T:
T:  ================================================
T:       MENTAL MATH TRAINER
T:  ================================================
T:
T:  Sharpen your arithmetic skills with 15
T:  problems across five categories:
T:
T:    [1]  Addition         (Problems  1 - 3)
T:    [2]  Subtraction      (Problems  4 - 6)
T:    [3]  Multiplication   (Problems  7 - 9)
T:    [4]  Division         (Problems 10 - 12)
T:    [5]  Mixed Operations (Problems 13 - 15)
T:
T:  Type your numeric answer for each problem.
T:  Your score is tracked automatically.
T:
T:  ================================================
T:
R:TIME
T:

* ---- Call each category ----
U:ADDITION
U:SUBTRACTION
U:MULTIPLICATION
U:DIVISION
U:MIXED

* ---- Final Results ----
T:
T:  ================================================
T:         FINAL RESULTS
T:  ================================================
T:
C:PERCENT=INT(SCORE*100/TOTAL)
T:  Score: {SCORE} correct out of {TOTAL}
T:  Percentage: {PERCENT}%
T:

J(PERCENT >= 90):RANK_A
J(PERCENT >= 70):RANK_B
J(PERCENT >= 50):RANK_C
T:  Grade: D -- Keep practicing, you will improve!
J:RANK_DONE

L:RANK_A
T:  Grade: A -- Outstanding! You are a math master!
J:RANK_DONE

L:RANK_B
T:  Grade: B -- Good work! Almost there!
J:RANK_DONE

L:RANK_C
T:  Grade: C -- Not bad, review and try again!

L:RANK_DONE
T:
T:  ================================================
T:  "Mathematics is the queen of the sciences."
T:                   -- Carl Friedrich Gauss
T:  ================================================
T:
R:TIME
END

* =================================================
*  ADDITION PROBLEMS
* =================================================
L:ADDITION
T:
T:  ---- ADDITION ----
T:

C:A=47
C:B=38
C:ANSWER=A+B
T:  Problem 1: What is {A} + {B} ?
A:RESPONSE
J(RESPONSE == ANSWER):A1_OK
T:    Incorrect. {A} + {B} = {ANSWER}
T:    Tip: 47 + 38 --> 47 + 40 - 2 = 85
J:A1_DONE
L:A1_OK
T:    Correct! {A} + {B} = {ANSWER}
C:SCORE=SCORE+1
L:A1_DONE
C:TOTAL=TOTAL+1
T:

C:A=156
C:B=289
C:ANSWER=A+B
T:  Problem 2: What is {A} + {B} ?
A:RESPONSE
J(RESPONSE == ANSWER):A2_OK
T:    Incorrect. {A} + {B} = {ANSWER}
T:    Tip: Add hundreds, tens, ones separately.
J:A2_DONE
L:A2_OK
T:    Correct! {A} + {B} = {ANSWER}
C:SCORE=SCORE+1
L:A2_DONE
C:TOTAL=TOTAL+1
T:

C:A=1234
C:B=4766
C:ANSWER=A+B
