A:RESPONSE
J(RESPONSE == ANSWER):D1_OK
T:    Incorrect. {A} / {B} = {ANSWER}
T:    Tip: 144 = 12 x 12, so 144 / 12 = 12
J:D1_DONE
L:D1_OK
T:    Correct! {A} / {B} = {ANSWER}
C:SCORE=SCORE+1
L:D1_DONE
C:TOTAL=TOTAL+1
